source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-3b5ac4c18010d359fc37","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-d4288ccd4470bb04ff2a","layer":"original","quote":"会张邈叛迎吕布，太祖还击布","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-bae6339aadb9077cb558","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-eb5fdf6d1207ecfe4545","layer":"original","quote":"兖州乱，翕、晖皆叛","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-041ab5ab00c4a4c06c3e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3641f77987147c318cae","layer":"pei","quote":"会太祖围下邳，成遂领众降","attribution":"裴注·九州春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8e2c5f07165c04d36c9a","start":187,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1833285c8d232cb8a9f0","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d86e39197497f88256bb","layer":"original","quote":"太祖自征布。至其城下，遗布书，为陈祸福〖2〗。布欲降，陈宫等自以负罪深，沮其计","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1d5c9a6c11cb5bec3896","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-66d8ed1a8c5b129739ae","layer":"original","quote":"刘备进曰：“明公不见布之事丁建阳及董太师乎〖8〗！”太祖颔之〖9〗。布因指备曰：“是儿最叵信者〖10〗！”﹝五﹞于是缢杀布〖11〗。布与宫、顺等皆枭首送许，然后葬之","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-36c63e849cb56a384f90","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-630d90f48255ffda7b80","layer":"pei","quote":"布问性，言‘萌受袁术谋’。‘谋者悉谁？’性言：‘陈宫同谋。’时宫在坐上，面赤，旁人悉觉之。布以宫大将，不问也","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c3c03b97c67239fef561","start":358,"end":412,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-634f6b032dc90294f9e8","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-505739a4d6561ea9c5e5","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖军至彭城。陈宫谓布：‘宜逆击之，以逸击劳，无不克也。’布曰：‘不如待其来攻，蹙著泗水中","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-362464fbb13e5e834f41","start":12,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-75cbe570c70c5329d02f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-89207ecfdd74ae282a34","layer":"original","quote":"布与其麾下登白门楼〖4〗，兵围急，乃下降，遂生缚布","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-7bba6c2542cc03d4898c","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-06f5b92881bcd273c2b0","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖泣而送之，宫不还顾。宫死后，太祖待其家皆厚如初","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7c80a4dae2dae7a40081","start":323,"end":348,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3ecb53f343c9ec34aa0e","layer":"original","quote":"邈弟超，与太祖将陈宫，从事中郎许汜、王楷，共谋叛太祖。宫说邈曰：“今雄杰并起，天下分崩；君以千里之众〖6〗，当四战之地〖7〗，抚剑顾眄〖8〗，亦足以为人豪；而反制于人，不以鄙乎？今州军东征〖9〗，其处空虚；吕布壮士，善战无前；若权迎之，共牧兖州；观天下形势，俟时事之变通〖10〗：此亦纵横之一时也！”邈从之","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-8f27277f15a97194d878","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-505739a4d6561ea9c5e5","layer":"pei","quote":"及太祖军攻之急，布于白门楼上谓军士曰：‘卿曹无相困，我（自首当）〔当自首〕明公。’陈宫曰：‘逆贼曹操，何等‘明公’！今日降之，若卵投石，岂可得全也","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-362464fbb13e5e834f41","start":59,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-ad37f7e24876bbfcba6c","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d86e39197497f88256bb","layer":"original","quote":"布遣人求救于（术术）〔袁术〕；自将千余骑出战，败。走还保城，不敢出","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-b3250c90b491c95f1382","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3ecb53f343c9ec34aa0e","layer":"original","quote":"太祖初使宫将兵留屯东郡，遂以其众，东迎布为兖州牧，据濮阳，郡县皆应。唯鄄城、东阿、范，为太祖守","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-c077f5e3db2ee782c27e","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-159cd164ea69a63a78e2","layer":"pei","quote":"陈宫谓布曰：‘曹公远来，势不能久。若将军以步骑出屯，为势于外，宫将余众闭守于内：若向将军，宫引兵而攻其背；若来攻城，将军为救于外。不过旬日，军食必尽，击之可破。’布然之。布妻曰：‘昔曹氏待公台如赤子，犹舍而来。今将军厚公台不过于曹公，而欲委全城，捐妻子，孤军远出；若一旦有变，妾岂得为将军妻哉！’布乃止","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0324e650424a8aac337a","start":9,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-c2847a531d2132afe2d2","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-89207ecfdd74ae282a34","layer":"original","quote":"太祖堑围之三月〖3〗，上下离心。其将侯成、宋宪、魏续，缚陈宫，将其众降","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-cd24258052e243fc9830","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-34ee8404b5682e6bd0e4","layer":"pei","quote":"布欲令陈宫、高顺守城，自将骑断太祖粮道；布妻谓曰：‘将军自出断曹公粮道，是也。宫、顺素不和，将军一出，宫、顺必不同心共城守也。如有蹉跌，将军当于何自立乎？愿将军谛计之，无为宫等所误也！妾昔在长安，已为将军所弃，赖得庞舒私藏妾身耳。今不须顾妾也。’布得妻言，愁闷不能自决","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0324e650424a8aac337a","start":151,"end":285,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-d7669625603413112b5f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-06f5b92881bcd273c2b0","layer":"pei","quote":"陈宫字公台，东郡人也。刚直烈壮，少与海内知名之士，皆相连结。及天下乱，始随太祖，后自疑，乃从吕布","attribution":"典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7c80a4dae2dae7a40081","start":12,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-d7cc619e98f9ea2ff02d","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-30812d8adeccd65f6901","layer":"original","quote":"太祖之擒宫也，问宫：“欲活老母及女不？”宫对曰：“宫闻孝治天下者不绝人之亲〖12〗，仁施四海者不乏人之祀〖13〗；老母在公〖14〗，不在宫也。”太祖召养其母，终其身；嫁其女","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-dd8b5ca217c015e2ba70","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-06f5b92881bcd273c2b0","layer":"pei","quote":"下邳败，军士执布及宫，太祖皆见之，与语平生，故布有求活之言。大祖谓宫曰：‘公台，卿平常自谓智计有余，今竟何如？’宫顾指布曰：‘但坐此人不从宫言，以至于此。若其见从，亦未必为擒也。’太祖笑曰：‘今日之事，当云何？’宫曰：‘为臣不忠，为子不孝；死，自分也！’太祖曰：‘卿如是，奈卿老母何？’宫曰：‘宫闻将以孝治天下者，不害人之亲；老母之存否，在明公也。’太祖曰：‘若卿妻子何？’宫曰：‘宫闻将施仁政于天下者，不绝人之祀；妻子之存否，亦在明公也。’太祖未复言。宫曰：‘请出就戮，以明军法！’遂趋出，不可止","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7c80a4dae2dae7a40081","start":73,"end":322,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-1e383e5b762f5fbdf776","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f7bf4f39640b854492a0","layer":"pei","quote":"吕布之乱，兖州皆叛；惟范、东阿完在：由祗以兵据城之力也","attribution":"裴注·魏武故事","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-60f466d9d92c616eb2c9","start":66,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o030a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e20b10a33611639b713","layer":"original","quote":"会张邈与陈宫叛迎吕布〖1〗，郡县皆应；荀彧、程昱保鄄城，范、东阿二县固守〖2〗。太祖乃引军还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o036b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-46b956aeab7b17efb940","layer":"original","quote":"布复从东缗与陈宫将万余人来战〖5〗。时太祖兵少，设伏，纵奇兵击；大破之，﹝一﹞布夜走。太祖复攻，拔定陶，分兵平诸县。布东奔刘备；张邈从布，使其弟超将家属保雍丘〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o058a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，屠彭城〖2〗，获其相侯谐。进至下邳，布自将骑逆击〖3〗。大破之，获其骁将成廉，追至城下。布恐，欲降。陈宫等沮其计〖4〗，求救于术，劝布出战。战又败，乃还固守；","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o058b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"攻之不下。时公连战，士卒疲，欲还；用荀攸、郭嘉计〖5〗，遂决泗、沂水以灌城〖6〗。月余，布将宋宪、魏续等执陈宫，举城降。生擒布、宫，皆杀之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p037a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-923b3640b464a66c29b2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“岱既死，陈宫谓太祖曰：‘州今无主，而王命断绝。宫请说州中，明府寻往牧之。资之以收天下，此霸王之业也。’宫说别驾、治中曰：‘今天下分裂而州无主。曹东郡，命世之才也；若迎以牧州，必宁生民。’鲍信等亦谓之然。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e4a6518d16f574fcb395","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4269a9733b31c7ed1578","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：建安三年（公元 198）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":327,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1273453201e8129c485c","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o030","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e20b10a33611639b713","layer":"original","quote":"会张邈与陈宫叛迎吕布〖1〗，郡县皆应；荀彧、程昱保鄄城，范、东阿二县固守〖2〗。太祖乃引军还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o035","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-94e8aac81304812fd313","layer":"original","quote":"二年春〖1〗，袭定陶。济阴太守吴资保南城〖2〗，未拔〖3〗。会吕布至，又击破之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o036","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-46b956aeab7b17efb940","layer":"original","quote":"夏，布将薛兰、李封屯钜野〖4〗，太祖攻之。布救兰，兰败；布走，遂斩兰等。布复从东缗与陈宫将万余人来战〖5〗。时太祖兵少，设伏，纵奇兵击；大破之，﹝一﹞布夜走。太祖复攻，拔定陶，分兵平诸县。布东奔刘备；张邈从布，使其弟超将家属保雍丘〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o054","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ec1ae0750950ac5532fb","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，公还许。初置军师祭酒〖2〗。三月，公围张绣于穰。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o058","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e667d99069ce89fe4e0","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，屠彭城〖2〗，获其相侯谐。进至下邳，布自将骑逆击〖3〗。大破之，获其骁将成廉，追至城下。布恐，欲降。陈宫等沮其计〖4〗，求救于术，劝布出战。战又败，乃还固守；攻之不下。时公连战，士卒疲，欲还；用荀攸、郭嘉计〖5〗，遂决泗、沂水以灌城〖6〗。月余，布将宋宪、魏续等执陈宫，举城降。生擒布、宫，皆杀之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p037","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-923b3640b464a66c29b2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《世语》曰：“岱既死，陈宫谓太祖曰：‘州今无主，而王命断绝。宫请说州中，明府寻往牧之。资之以收天下，此霸王之业也。’宫说别驾、治中曰：‘今天下分裂而州无主。曹东郡，命世之才也；若迎以牧州，必宁生民。’鲍信等亦谓之然。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e4a6518d16f574fcb395","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o009","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-939a0c2b5149377c476b","layer":"original","quote":"谦表先主为豫州刺史，屯小沛〖2〗。谦病笃，谓别驾麋竺曰〖3〗：“非刘备，不能安此州也！”谦死，竺率州人迎先主。先主未敢当，下邳陈登谓先主曰：“今汉室陵迟，海内倾覆；立功立事，在于今日！（彼）〔鄙〕州殷富〖4〗，户口百万；欲屈使君，抚临州事。”先主曰：“袁公路近在寿春〖5〗；此君四世五公〖6〗，海内所归；君可以州与之。”登曰：“公路骄豪，非治乱之主！今欲为使君合步骑十万：上可以匡主济民，成五霸之业〖7〗；下可以割地守境，书功于竹帛。若使君不见听许，登亦未敢听使君也！”北海相孔融谓先主曰：“袁公路岂忧国忘家者邪？冢中枯骨〖8〗，何足介意！今日之事，百姓与能〖9〗；天与不取，悔不可追！”先主遂领徐州。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":304,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o007a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年，太祖征陶谦，任彧留事〖4〗。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o007","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年，太祖征陶谦，任彧留事〖4〗。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。布既至，邈乃使刘翊告彧曰：“吕将军来助曹使君击陶谦〖5〗。宜亟供其军食！”众疑惑。彧知邈为乱，即勒兵设备〖6〗；驰召东郡太守夏侯惇。而兖州诸城皆应布矣。时太祖悉军攻谦，留守兵少；而督将、大吏多与邈、宫通谋〖7〗。惇至，其夜诛谋叛者数十人，众乃定。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o010","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-4d4e69d499acbe809653","layer":"original","quote":"陶谦死，太祖欲遂取徐州，还乃定布。彧曰：“昔高祖保关中，光武据河内，皆深根固本以制天下；进足以胜敌，退足以坚守。故虽有困败，而终济大业。将军本以兖州首事〖1〗，平山东之难，百姓无不归心悦服。且河、济〖2〗，天下之要地也；今虽残坏，犹易以自保；是亦将军之关中、河内也，不可以不先定。今已破李封、薛兰，若分兵东击陈宫，宫必不敢西顾；以其间勒兵收熟麦〖3〗，约食蓄谷〖4〗，一举而布可破也。破布，然后南结扬州；共讨袁术，以临淮、泗。若舍布而东，多留兵则不足用〖5〗，少留兵则民皆保城，不得樵采。布乘虚寇暴，民心益危；唯鄄城、范、卫可全，其余非己之有：是无兖州也。若徐州不定，将军当安所归乎？且陶谦虽死，徐州未易亡也。彼惩往年之败，将惧而结亲〖6〗，相为表里〖7〗。今东方皆已收麦，必坚壁清野，以待将军；将军攻之不拔，略之无获；不出十日，则十万之众，未战而自困耳。﹝一﹞前讨徐州，威罚实行〖8〗；﹝二﹞其子弟念父兄之耻，必人自为守，无降心；就能破之〖9〗，尚不可有也。夫事固有弃此取彼者〖10〗：以大易小，可也；以安易危，可也；权一时之势〖11〗，不患本之不固，可也〖12〗。今三者莫利，愿将军熟虑之！”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":498,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o041","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9a7d4ad6df8888c3edb8","layer":"original","quote":"攸与郭嘉说曰：“吕布勇而无谋，今三战皆北〖4〗，其锐气衰矣。三军以将为主，主衰则军无奋意；夫陈宫，有智而迟。今及布气之未复〖5〗，宫谋之未定；进，急攻之，布可拔也。”乃引沂、泗灌城，城溃，生擒布。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6bf1b1254f8ab107a819","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-e051f0c32d3c8e964731","layer":"original","quote":"布诛，涣得归太祖","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
